OL,3,GNEWSAFree festive days out in Yorkshire
OL,4,Athis Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith less than a month to go before
OL,7,FChristmas the festivities are ramping
OL,8,Fup across Yorkshire.
OL,10,FFrom twinkling lights and torchlit
OL,11,Fprocessions to Snoopy trails and even a
OL,12,Fcrustacean inspired Christmas tree,
OL,13,Fhere's a few of the free events taking
OL,14,Fplace to help keep costs down and
OL,15,Fexcitement levels up.
OL,17,FHarrogate is hosting an Ice Sculpture
OL,18,FTrail on 12 December and two
OL,19,Ffree-to-play Curling Lanes every
OL,20,Fweekend until Christmas, along with
OL,21,Fstreet entertainment and the North Pole
OL,22,FPost Office.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
